Linux's turbostat readings of the ThinkPad T14, moved out of ToyOS by PR #929.

Origin: ToyOS tests/metal/t14-linux/, byte-identical to the files at ToyOS
2c3f61a3e (main before #929); first committed in ToyOS ce1786ff0 (2026-10-04).
SOURCE is that directory's own provenance: read as root by the orchestrator
on 2026-10-03 under the T14's Ubuntu 6.8.0-142-generic, powersave governor,
each file as turbostat printed it, with the command that took it.

Status: a black-box measurement of Linux on the same machine. No ToyOS test
reads it; issues/linuxs-readings-of-the-t14-and-the-tcg-model-lack-reads-owed-before-the-t14s-wipe.md
records it as a measurement.

